:: localization speaker=narrator scene="radiocomputer" beat="notice"
> notice_01@1111111111111111111b speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert"
  Clock notice: Meridian Station reports minute zero before the embassy relay.
> notice_02@1111111111111111111c speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert"
  Wire notice: the recorder head was reversed after the first spoken name.
> notice_03@1111111111111111111d speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert"
  Seal notice: diplomatic wax contains railway grit from the eastern loop.
> notice_04@1111111111111111111e speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert"
  Clerk notice: the station log omits one passenger with military clearance.
> notice_05@1111111111111111111f speaker=radiocomputer portrait="lamp" camera="insert"
  Cipher notice: LACUNA's card answers to a bureau key retired in 1919.
> localization_prompt@11111111111111111120 speaker=operator portrait="listening" beat="choice"
  The lamps sort the night into proofs, but none of them say why she called.
  ? follow_archive@21111111111111111119 object=radiocomputer_console tone="analytical"
    Follow the clock variance through the radiocomputer tables.
    -> src/effects.recite::effects
  ? follow_watch@2111111111111111111a quest=case_lamplight tone="severe"
    Follow the wire recording and challenge her last sentence.
